OL,3,GNEWSAFlight disruption and thousands
OL,4,Awithout electricity after Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes across the island of
OL,7,FIreland are without power after Storm
OL,8,FBoelo.
OL,10,FThe worst impacted areas in Northern
OL,11,FIreland include Springfield in County
OL,12,FFermanagh and Bushmills in County
OL,13,FAntrim, where more than 1,000 homes
OL,14,Fnear each village are without power.
OL,16,FAbout 41,000 homes, farms and
OL,17,Fbusinesses across the Republic of
OL,18,FIreland are without electricity on
OL,19,FSunday morning.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
